              "translation": "那一天来临"
            }
          ],
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Spring arrived early this year.",
              "zh": "今年春天来得早。"
            },
            {
              "en": "The long-awaited day finally arrived.",
              "zh": "期待已久的那一天终于到来。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "synonyms": [
        "come：更日常；arrive 更突出某个时刻终于到了。"
      ],
      "antonyms": [],
      "confusables": [
        "这里的 arrive 是时间来临，不是人乘车抵达。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
